#: ../../how-it-works.rst:2
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "实现原理"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit is small because it does very little at runtime. Three formats are "
"read directly, and everything else is prepared once, at build time."
msgstr "Orbit 之所以小，是因为运行时几乎什么都不做。三种格式直接读取，其余都在构建期准备好。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:8
msgid "Sequence: 2bit"
msgstr "序列：2bit"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:10
msgid ""
"The 2bit format packs four bases into a byte plus an index of block "
"offsets, so a random 20 kb window can be decoded without touching the "
"rest of the file. Orbit's reader (:mod:`igvlocal.twobit`) implements the "
"format with the standard library only — no py2bit, no C extension."
msgstr ""
"2bit 格式把四个碱基压进一个字节，另带一份数据块偏移索引，所以解码任意 20 kb 窗口都不必碰文件其余部分。Orbit 的读取器 "
":mod:`igvlocal.twobit` 只用标准库实现——不需要 py2bit，也不需要 C 扩展。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:15
msgid ""
"When the file is remote, the same reader works through HTTP Range "
"requests: it fetches the index once, then only the blocks the window "
"overlaps. This is why the installer does not ship a genome."
msgstr "文件在远端时，同一个读取器通过 HTTP Range 工作：索引取一次，之后只取窗口覆盖的块。安装包因此不需要附带基因组。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:20
msgid "Annotation: igvbin"
msgstr "注释：igvbin"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:22
msgid ""
"RefSeq ``refGene`` is a flat table of exon starts and ends encoded as "
"comma-separated strings. Parsing it at startup costs seconds and hundreds"
" of megabytes. So it is compiled once into ``genes.igvbin``:"
msgstr ""
"RefSeq 的 ``refGene`` 是一张平表，外显子起止被编码成逗号分隔的字符串。启动时解析它要几秒和几百 MB "
"内存。所以它被一次性编译成 ``genes.igvbin``："

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:26
msgid "a header with chromosome count and offsets"
msgstr "一个头部，记录染色体数量和偏移"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:27
msgid "a per-chromosome block of gene records, sorted by start"
msgstr "按染色体分块的基因记录，按起点排序"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:28
msgid "an interned string pool for symbols and accessions"
msgstr "符号与编号共用的字符串池"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:29
msgid "a transcript table, so expansion does not re-read the gene"
msgstr "一张转录本表，展开时不必重读基因"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:31
msgid ""
"Loading a chromosome becomes a single ``mmap`` slice plus a binary "
"search, which is why a whole chromosome of genes appears in milliseconds."
" The reader (:mod:`igvlocal.annbin`) is about 300 lines and has no "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"加载一条染色体变成一次 ``mmap`` 切片加一次二分查找，所以整条染色体的基因能在毫秒级出现。读取器 "
":mod:`igvlocal.annbin` 约 300 行，无任何依赖。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:36
msgid "Signal: bigWig"
msgstr "信号：bigWig"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:38
msgid ""
"bigWig is a binary, indexed format: a B-tree of data blocks and an R-tree"
" of genomic ranges. Orbit parses both (:mod:`igvlocal.bigwig`) and reads "
"only the blocks covering the window."
msgstr ""
"bigWig 是带索引的二进制格式：数据块的 B 树加基因组区间的 R 树。Orbit 两者都解析 "
":mod:`igvlocal.bigwig`，只读窗口覆盖的块。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:42
msgid ""
"That means a 40 GB bigWig behaves like a small file — the cost of opening"
" it is a few hundred bytes of index, not the whole track. bedGraph files "
"are the exception: they have no index, so they are read into memory."
msgstr ""
"这意味着 40 GB 的 bigWig 表现得像个小文件——打开它的代价是几百字节索引，而不是整条轨道。bedGraph "
"是例外：它没有索引，只能整份读进内存。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:47
msgid "The server"
msgstr "服务端"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:49
msgid ""
"The backend is a single-threaded HTTP server from the standard library. "
"It serves three things:"
msgstr "后端是标准库里单线程的 HTTP 服务，只提供三样东西："

