msgstr "``/api/...``"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:61
msgid "JSON: catalog, genes in a window, sequence, bigWig values, search"
msgstr "JSON：装配清单、窗口内基因、序列、bigWig 数值、搜索"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:62
msgid "``/export/...``"
msgstr "``/export/...``"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:63
msgid "Rendered exports"
msgstr "渲染好的导出文件"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:65
msgid ""
"The window itself is QtWebEngine, so the frontend is ordinary browser "
"code — Canvas for tracks, plain DOM for controls, no framework. The same "
"page runs in Chrome if you pass ``--browser``, which is how most of the "
"UI is tested."
msgstr ""
"窗口本身是 QtWebEngine，所以前端就是普通浏览器代码——轨道用 Canvas，控件用原生 DOM，没有框架。加 "
"``--browser`` 时同一个页面也能在 Chrome 里跑，UI 的大部分测试就是这么做的。"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:70
msgid "Why this shape"
msgstr "为什么这样设计"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:76
msgid "Decision"
msgstr "决策"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:77
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "理由"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:78
msgid "No framework"
msgstr "不用框架"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:79
msgid "The whole frontend is one file and loads instantly; there is no build step"
msgstr "整个前端就是一个文件，加载即用，没有构建步骤"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:80
msgid "Standard library only"
msgstr "只用标准库"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:81
msgid "No wheels to compile, no version conflicts, and the frozen build is small"
msgstr "没有要编译的 wheel，没有版本冲突，冻结产物也小"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:82
msgid "Compile annotations ahead of time"
msgstr "注释提前编译"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:83
msgid "Startup cost moves to the build machine, where it is paid once"
msgstr "启动开销转移到构建机上，只需付一次"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:84
msgid "Stream sequence"
msgstr "序列走流式"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:85
msgid "A 3 GB genome is not something you want in an installer"
msgstr "3 GB 的基因组不该塞进安装包"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:86
msgid "Qt over a web view"
msgstr "用 Qt 而不是纯网页"

#: ../../how-it-works.rst:87
msgid "Same rendering engine as Chrome, but a real window and real file dialogs"
msgstr "与 Chrome 同一个渲染引擎，但有真正的窗口和原生文件对话框"

msgid "Frontend export"
msgstr "前端导出"

msgid "``composePlot`` / ``composeVector`` generate the downloadable files"
msgstr "``composePlot`` / ``composeVector`` 生成可下载的导出文件"

msgid "Bundled newer build"
msgstr "内置较新版本"

msgid "Bundled older build"
msgstr "内置较旧版本"

msgid "UCSC ncbiRefSeq / sgdGene"
msgstr "UCSC ncbiRefSeq / sgdGene"

msgid "Response time depends on the network and reference index."
msgstr "响应时间取决于网络状况和参考索引。"

msgid ""
"The range cache is in memory and per session, not a persistent offline "
"genome."
msgstr "区间缓存位于内存中，仅在本次会话有效，不是持久保存的离线基因组。"

msgid "Local 2bit takes priority over the remote source."
msgstr "本地 2bit 优先于远程序列源。"

msgid ""
"For a second instance, use a different port. To isolate imported data "
"too, prepare a separate compatible data folder and pass it with "
"``--data``:"
msgstr "第二个实例应使用不同端口。如需同时隔离导入数据，请准备独立且结构兼容的数据目录，并通过 ``--data`` 指定："

msgid ""
"Changing the port alone does not isolate data. Do not rely on an "
"unsupported ``ORBIT_HOME`` setting to separate research files."
msgstr "只更换端口不会隔离数据。不要依赖未支持的 ``ORBIT_HOME`` 设置来隔离科研文件。"

msgid ""
"User data may remain in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit`` or the application data "
"folder. Back up imported research files before uninstalling. Do not "
"delete an entire user-data folder merely to reset colours or another "
"display preference."
msgstr ""
"用户数据可能仍保存在 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit`` "
"或应用数据目录中。卸载前请备份导入的科研文件，不要仅为了重置颜色等显示偏好而删除整个用户数据目录。"

msgid ""
"The backend uses the standard library ThreadingHTTPServer, bound to "
"localhost by default. It serves the frontend and JSON APIs; the frontend "
"composes exports."
msgstr "后端采用标准库 ThreadingHTTPServer，默认绑定本机地址。它提供前端页面与 JSON API；导出由前端合成。"

